OL,3,GNEWSAHackney voters show Labour's
OL,4,ALondon challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Andy Burnham begins his first
OL,7,FLabour conference as Prime Minister,
OL,8,Fvoters in parts of London say their
OL,9,Ffocus is less on party politics and
OL,10,Fmore on the cost of everyday life.
OL,12,FIn Hackney, the once Labour
OL,13,Fstrong-hold, locals told Politics
OL,14,FLondon of their financial worries and
OL,15,Fdisillusionment with politics.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
